---
layout: base.njk
nav: analysis
pagination:
  data: ledgers.orders
  size: 1
  alias: l
permalink: "{{ l.url }}"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ l.title }}"
  description: "{{ l.excerpt }}"
---
<article class="ledger-page orders-page">
  <header class="lhead">
  <div class="crumb"><a href="/">The file</a> › <a href="/analyses/">Analyses</a></div>
  <h1>{{ l.title }}</h1>
  <p class="sub">Every presidential order that prohibits or unwinds a foreign acquisition under
    Section 721 of the Defense Production Act (50 U.S.C. 4565), 1990 to now — one row per order,
    newest first, with amending orders folded beneath the order they change.</p>
  <div class="meta-col">
  <p class="stamp">Currency: last accepted change {{ l.currency_date or "—" }} · {{ l.count }} order{{ "s" if l.count != 1 }}.</p>
  <p class="stamp-note">These orders are not numbered Executive Orders, so an Executive Order search misses
    them. Acquirer country is the country of the ultimate controlling parent as the order describes it.
    Deadlines show the days the order allows and, where the clock starts on the order date, the resulting
    date. Status is set by the editor and links its source. Fields not yet reviewed show as
    <span class="pending">pending</span>.</p>
  </div>
  </header>

  <div class="controls">
    <input id="q" type="search" placeholder="Filter by acquirer, target, country, sector, President, or citation…" aria-label="Filter orders">
    <span class="count" id="count"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="scroll">
  <table id="ledger" data-noun="orders">
    <colgroup>
      <col style="width:8%"><col style="width:6%"><col style="width:16%"><col style="width:9%"><col style="width:14%">
      <col style="width:10%"><col style="width:8%"><col style="width:10%"><col style="width:10%"><col style="width:9%">
    </colgroup>
    <thead><tr>
      <th data-key="date" aria-sort="descending"><span class="lab">Signed</span></th>
      <th data-key="president"><span class="lab">President</span></th>
      <th data-key="acquirer"><span class="lab">Acquirer</span></th>
      <th data-key="country" class="wrap"><span class="lab">Country (ultimate)</span></th>
      <th data-key="target"><span class="lab">Target</span></th>
      <th data-key="sector"><span class="lab">Sector</span></th>
      <th data-key="action"><span class="lab">Action</span></th>
      <th data-key="deadline"><span class="lab">Deadline</span></th>
      <th data-key="status"><span class="lab">Status</span></th>
      <th data-key="links"><span class="lab">Source</span></th>
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    {% for row in l.rows %}
      {% set d = row.deadline %}
      <tr class="row" data-search="{{ row.search }}">
        <td class="date">{{ row.date }}</td>
        <td>{% if row.pending.president %}<span class="pending">pending</span>{% else %}{{ row.president }}{% endif %}</td>
        <td><button class="expand" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Show details">+</button> {{ row.acquirer }}{% if row.acquirer_parent %}<span class="basis">parent: {{ row.acquirer_parent }}</span>{% endif %}{% if row.foldcount %}<span class="foldnote">+ {{ row.foldcount }} folded: {{ row.foldsummary }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if row.pending.country %}<span class="pending">pending</span>{% else %}{{ row.country }}{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if row.pending.target %}<span class="pending">pending</span>{% else %}{{ row.target }}{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="nobreak">{% if row.pending.sector %}<span class="pending">pending</span>{% else %}{{ row.sector | replace("/", "/<wbr>") | safe }}{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if row.pending.action %}<span class="pending">pending</span>{% else %}{{ row.action }}{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if row.pending.deadline %}<span class="pending">pending</span>
          {%- elif d.absent %}—
          {%- elif d.extended_to %}<span class="dl">{% if d.has_days %}{{ d.days }} days {% endif %}(<s>{{ d.date }}</s> → {{ d.extended_to }})</span><span class="basis">extended · {{ d.extension_source }}</span>
          {%- elif d.stated %}<span class="dl">{% if d.has_days %}{{ d.days }} days, {% endif %}by {{ d.date }}</span>
          {%- elif d.date %}<span class="dl">{{ d.days }} days ({{ d.date }})</span>
          {%- else %}<span class="dl">{{ d.days }} days</span>{% if d.basis %}<span class="basis">{{ d.basis }}</span>{% endif %}{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{% if row.pending.status %}<span class="pending">pending</span>{% else %}<span class="status {{ row.status_class }}">{{ row.status }}</span><span class="src">source: {% if row.status_source.startsWith("http") %}<a href="{{ row.status_source }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">link</a>{% else %}{{ row.status_source }}{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}</td>
        <td>{{ row.docket }}<span class="basis"><a href="{{ row.record_url }}">record</a>{% if row.pdf_url %} · <a href="{{ row.pdf_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF</a>{% endif %}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="detail" hidden><td colspan="10">
        <div class="terms{% if row.pending.terms %} pending-note{% endif %}">
          <strong>What the order requires</strong>
          {% if row.pending.terms %}<span class="pending">Not yet reviewed — fields are proposed from the order text and accepted by the editor.</span>
          {% else %}<ul>{% for t in row.terms %}<li>{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if row.history.length %}
        <div class="history"><strong>Order history and related records</strong>
          <ul>
          {% for h in row.history %}
            <li><span class="rel {{ h.rel }}">{{ h.rel }}</span>{{ h.label }} · <span class="date">{{ h.date }}</span>{% if h.docket %} · {{ h.docket }}{% endif %} · <a href="{{ h.record_url }}">record</a>{% if h.pdf_url %} · <a href="{{ h.pdf_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF</a>{% endif %}</li>
          {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
      <tr class="noresults" hidden><td colspan="10">No orders match the current filter.</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>

  {% if l.footnote %}<p class="footnote">{{ l.footnote | safe }}</p>{% endif %}

  <div class="methodology">
    <p>Rendered at build time from the mirrored Records and the analysis mesh. A row is a Record tagged
    <code>cfius</code> with document type “presidential order”. Field values are analyst-reviewed
    summaries of the order, each accepted with a citation to the Record and page — not the order text.
    Exports (reviewed fields, with build timestamp): <a href="{{ l.url }}{{ l.id }}.csv">CSV</a> ·
    <a href="{{ l.url }}{{ l.id }}.json">JSON</a>.</p>
  </div>
</article>
<script src="/js/ledger.js" defer></script>
